{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703320/extras/Cabe\u00e7alho_da_biblioteca.png?t=1748531433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers the <strong>first 20\u201330 minutes</strong> of the game <i>Revella</i>, a story-rich psychological horror RPG.<br>You will follow <strong>Aveline</strong>, a quiet girl with a forgotten past, as she wakes up in her home and steps outside into a strange and fading world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo introduces:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>opening chapter</strong> of the narrative, establishing key themes of memory, identity, and trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>first explorable area</strong>, a withering village filled with atmospheric pixel art and unsettling NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two battles</strong> featuring behavior-based turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactions with <strong>unique villagers</strong>, each with cryptic dialogue and their own emotional subplots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue choices</strong> that affect how some NPCs will respond to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric <strong>soundtrack</strong> setting a haunting tone for the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An introduction to the game\u2019s <strong>ghost mechanic</strong>, where forgotten spirits whisper fragmented truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning\u2014your decisions already carry weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Revella</i>, not the complete game. The experience is designed to provide a <strong>narrative and emotional preview</strong> of the full game\u2019s tone and pacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have feedback, you can join our Discord server or use the Steam community tab for suggestions, or feedback on bugs and etc!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703320/0a4b87d732d7eed185e490078420cb2aa524340c.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703320?t=1748531433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703320/91a77f5a5678de40c6a004dc33eaf11a682543da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748531433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703320/82114f3baecbf942467889412957ac49db327032/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748531433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703320/82114f3baecbf942467889412957ac49db327032/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748531433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703320/extras/Cabe\u00e7alho_da_biblioteca.png?t=1748531433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers the <strong>first 20\u201330 minutes</strong> of the game <i>Revella</i>, a story-rich psychological horror RPG.<br>You will follow <strong>Aveline</strong>, a quiet girl with a forgotten past, as she wakes up in her home and steps outside into a strange and fading world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo introduces:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>opening chapter</strong> of the narrative, establishing key themes of memory, identity, and trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>first explorable area</strong>, a withering village filled with atmospheric pixel art and unsettling NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two battles</strong> featuring behavior-based turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactions with <strong>unique villagers</strong>, each with cryptic dialogue and their own emotional subplots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue choices</strong> that affect how some NPCs will respond to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric <strong>soundtrack</strong> setting a haunting tone for the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An introduction to the game\u2019s <strong>ghost mechanic</strong>, where forgotten spirits whisper fragmented truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning\u2014your decisions already carry weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Revella</i>, not the complete game. The experience is designed to provide a <strong>narrative and emotional preview</strong> of the full game\u2019s tone and pacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have feedback, you can join our Discord server or use the Steam community tab for suggestions, or feedback on bugs and etc!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2>","developers":["Narrativa Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3703150","name":"Revella"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/370332